      "author": {
        "id": 1959861
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-03T03:15:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree that it replies on BT Controller\u0027s scheduler. In some phones, I\u0027ve seen connection performance could be downgraded so much by 100% duty cycle LE scan and we may not want to heavily rely on BT Controller\u0027s performance. I thought 25% duty cycle of LE scan (Balanced Mode) for 6 seconds doesn\u0027t break user experience.\n\nThis feature was initiated from SASS audio switching and I\u0027ve run some experiments on it. Please refer slides in \nhttps://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1w5vtbi0sDuKTjOtPt24qmwXPj7545yUuL4PURZcwZ7E/edit#slide\u003did.g14767bb3830_0_0",
      "parentUuid": "6eb03bb7_6a9bfde6",
      "revId": "5984c0b48646c25335189891f5b6b03b99b611ad",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
