      "writtenOn": "2022-10-03T03:15:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The source to report connecting state could be multiple like different remote devices or profiles. Instead of tracking the connecting/connected process from multiple sources, current logic simply refreshes the 6 second (default, configurable) timer whenever connecting state is reported.",
